{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1747000/extras/41766aca97d3c1289b9767bb9be141ea.avif?t=1761185015\" data-has-big width=1560 height=504 /></span><i>A survival crafting game set in the forgotten forests of the Pacific Northwest.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the summer of 1990, a series of solar flares\u2014known as <i>The Helios Surge</i>\u2014fractured Earth\u2019s magnetic field and triggered a global infrastructure collapse. Electronics failed. Navigation broke. Time itself unraveled.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Into the Wilderness</i>, you play a survivor navigating a timeless landscape where nature reclaims everything. No working radios. No reliable maps. No one left to call for help.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival means listening to the land, scavenging what remains, and rebuilding from memory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Explore a handcrafted forest</i> filled with forgotten shelters buried beneath moss each telling a story of survival</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Manage survival stats</i> like hunger, thirst, rest, and health in a dynamic day/night cycle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Craft and maintain shelters</i> using scavenged materials and legacy blueprints</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Restore broken radio towers</i> to uncover lost transmissions and piece together the past</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Immerse yourself in an\u00a0</i>atmospheric world inspired by <i>The Long Dark, Among Trees and Firewatch</i></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1747000?t=1761185015","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1747000?t=1761185015","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1747000/56ed6a47036611fd4c3c0a1624a40fa0162f461b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761185015","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1747000/56ed6a47036611fd4c3c0a1624a40fa0162f461b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761185015","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This Game may contain content not appropriate for all ages. General mature content."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1747000/extras/41766aca97d3c1289b9767bb9be141ea.avif?t=1761185015\" data-has-big width=1560 height=504 /></span><i>A survival crafting game set in the forgotten forests of the Pacific Northwest.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the summer of 1990, a series of solar flares\u2014known as <i>The Helios Surge</i>\u2014fractured Earth\u2019s magnetic field and triggered a global infrastructure collapse. Electronics failed. Navigation broke. Time itself unraveled.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Into the Wilderness</i>, you play a survivor navigating a timeless landscape where nature reclaims everything. No working radios. No reliable maps. No one left to call for help.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival means listening to the land, scavenging what remains, and rebuilding from memory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Explore a handcrafted forest</i> filled with forgotten shelters buried beneath moss each telling a story of survival</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Manage survival stats</i> like hunger, thirst, rest, and health in a dynamic day/night cycle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Craft and maintain shelters</i> using scavenged materials and legacy blueprints</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Restore broken radio towers</i> to uncover lost transmissions and piece together the past</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Immerse yourself in an\u00a0</i>atmospheric world inspired by <i>The Long Dark, Among Trees and Firewatch</i></p></li></ul>","developers":["Get Lost Game Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1747000/815997f0b45a144982c9579bd59b185d45e47f23/header.jpg?t=1761185015","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Into The Wilderness","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.6 GHz Dual Core or similar<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 500 series or similar<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 6 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Get Lost Game Studio"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia","rating":"14","required_age":"14","use_age_gate":"true"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"To be announced"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1747000/55380d8a72078e0af36594bbe07d99ec2640ec21/ss_55380d8a72078e0af36594bbe07d99ec2640ec21.1920x1080.jpg?t=1761185015","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1747000/55380d8a72078e0af36594bbe07d99ec2640ec21/ss_55380d8a72078e0af36594bbe07d99ec2640ec21.600x338.jpg?t=1761185015"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_